<title>DENMARK: Danish FLS six-month 96 profit soars.</title>
<headline>Danish FLS six-month 96 profit soars.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996</p>
<p>					  (million crowns unless stated)</p>
<p> Group pre-tax result		  327 vs  240</p>
<p> Group net result		     207  vs  190</p>
<p> Group net turnover		  9,334 vs  8,204</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Danish cement, engineering and aerospace group is FLS Industries A/S. It said in a statement that it expected ongoing progress in the second half of 1996. The result was broadly in line with analyst expectations.</p>
<p>--Copenhagen newsroom, 45-33-969650</p>
</text>
